The basics
[] Users can sign up and log in
[] Shop for products page
[] Users can fill cart, pick order type and time, then place order with neccessary details (date, address, type, etc)
[] Employees can see placed orders, select one order, then mark items as "picked" one by one
[] Employees can mark orders as delivered
[] Admins (managers) can see inventory levels, order more of a product, and review placed orders

More advanced
[] Substitution items
[] Partial quantities available
[] Rewards points

Super advanced